The country requirement files in specs/ are this project's own research. Each one records the
official source it was read from, the date it was last verified, and how confident that reading
is. They are facts about published government rules, not creative work, but the sourcing and
the honest record of what could NOT be verified took real effort. If you reuse them, keep the
sources and the status fields with them.

reference/python/ is a prototype pipeline kept as a behavioural oracle for the Swift port. It
is not shipped in the app and is not used at runtime.
